    {
      "source": "Construct an <code>HttpHandlerConnector</code> with the supplied <a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/SslInfo.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>SslInfo</code></a>\nand <a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/HttpHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>HttpHandler</code></a> to handle requests with.",
      "translation": "构造一个带有提供的<a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/SslInfo.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>SslInfo</code></a>和<a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/HttpHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>HttpHandler</code></a>的<code>HttpHandlerConnector</code>来处理请求。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Construct an <code>HttpHandlerConnector</code> with the supplied <a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/HttpHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>HttpHandler</code></a>\nto handle requests with.",
      "translation": "使用提供的<a href=\"../../../../http/server/reactive/HttpHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>HttpHandler</code></a>构建一个<code>HttpHandlerConnector</code>来处理请求。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Internally the connector uses and adapts<br/>\n<a href=\"../../../../mock/http/client/reactive/MockClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.client.reactive\"><code>MockClientHttpRequest</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../mock/http/client/reactive/MockClientHttpResponse.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.client.reactive\"><code>MockClientHttpResponse</code></a> to<br/>\n<a href=\"../../../../mock/http/server/reactive/MockServerHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.server.reactive\"><code>MockServerHttpRequest</code></a> and <a href=\"../../../../mock/http/server/reactive/MockServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.server.reactive\"><code>MockServerHttpResponse</code></a>.",
      "translation": "内部连接器使用并适配<br/>\n<a href=\"../../../../mock/http/client/reactive/MockClientHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.client.reactive\"><code>MockClientHttpRequest</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../../../mock/http/client/reactive/MockClientHttpResponse.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.client.reactive\"><code>MockClientHttpResponse</code></a>，以<br/>\n<a href=\"../../../../mock/http/server/reactive/MockServerHttpRequest.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.server.reactive\"><code>MockServerHttpRequest</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../../../../mock/http/server/reactive/MockServerHttpResponse.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.mock.http.server.reactive\"><code>MockServerHttpResponse</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Indicates that an error occurred after the server response was completed,\nvia <a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a> or <a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a>,\nand can no longer be changed.",
      "translation": "表示在服务器响应完成后，通过<a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a>或<a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a>发生了错误，且无法再更改。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Connect to the origin server using the given <code>HttpMethod</code> and\n<code>URI</code> and apply the given <code>requestCallback</code> when the HTTP\nrequest of the underlying API can be initialized and written to.",
      "translation": "使用给定的 `<code>HttpMethod</code>` 和 `<code>URI</code>` 连接到源服务器，并在底层 API 的 HTTP 请求可以初始化并写入时应用给定的 `<code>requestCallback</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../../http/client/reactive/ClientHttpConnector.html#connect(org.springframework.http.HttpMethod,java.net.URI,java.util.function.Function)\">ClientHttpConnector</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../../http/client/reactive/ClientHttpConnector.html#connect(org.springframework.http.HttpMethod,java.net.URI,java.util.function.Function)\">ClientHttpConnector</a></code></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>requestCallback</code> - a function that prepares and writes to the request,\nreturning a publisher that signals when it's done writing.\nImplementations can return a <code>Mono&lt;Void&gt;</code> by calling\n<a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a> or <a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>requestCallback</code> - 一个准备并向请求写入数据的函数，返回一个在写入完成后发出信号的 Publisher。实现可以通过调用<a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#writeWith(org.reactivestreams.Publisher)\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.writeWith(Publisher)</code></a>或<a href=\"../../../../http/ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.html#setComplete()\"><code>ReactiveHttpOutputMessage.setComplete()</code></a>返回一个<code>Mono&lt;Void&gt;</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../../http/client/reactive/ClientHttpConnector.html#connect(org.springframework.http.HttpMethod,java.net.URI,java.util.function.Function)\">connect</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../../http/client/reactive/ClientHttpConnector.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.client.reactive\">ClientHttpConnector</a></code>",
